# cold-lava board WORKSPACE, with no file: the picker's filter and Enter open a board the
# workspace has, and q on it ends the program. tests/drive.rs checks the canvas is byte for
# byte as it was.
size 140x30
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
type welc
wait-for + new board "welc.canvas"
expect Welcome.canvas
expect-not Volcano Venn.canvas
keys enter
wait-for whiteboard Welcome
screen
keys q
exits 0
